The following components were extracted, modified, and redistributed:
- Agent core (react_agent.py) — ReActAgent with ToolGuardMixin
- Memory management (BaseMemoryManager, ReMeLight, AgentMd)
- Tool registry (file I/O, shell, browser, media, agent ops)
- Security framework (ToolGuard, FileGuard, SkillScanner)
- Mission mode (PRD generation, phased execution)
- Multi-agent runtime (workspace isolation, service lifecycle)
- Configuration models (Pydantic schemas)
- Agent hooks (bootstrap, memory compaction)

Modifications are documented in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md at the project root.
